record.field:
Dear {partner},
Our records show that some invoices on your account are still unpaid. The details are below. If you have already paid, please ignore this message; otherwise kindly settle the amount of {total_overdue} at your earliest convenience.
Best regards, {company}

Dear {partner},
Despite our previous reminder, your account still shows an overdue balance of {total_overdue}. Please arrange the payment within 7 days or contact us if there is any issue with these invoices.
Best regards, {company}

Dear {partner},
This is our final notice. The overdue balance of {total_overdue} must be paid within 5 days. Without payment we will put your account on hold and may pass the file to collection.
Regards, {company}
